[?2004l=== field rules ===
Layout table lines:
  STRUCT <name>
  FIELD <name> <kind> <offset> <size>

Kinds: u32, u64. u64 fields use eight-byte little-endian values in capture blobs.
Sample blobs are little-endian packed fields in field order.
sched_entity fields include pid, weight, migration_flags, slice_ns.

procance.tag is one line: live:<release> or bundle:<release>
offline guard stamp: /app/lagpipe/synctab_out/offline_guard.ok

CLI entry: /app/bin/kernscribe synctab | inspect <capture>
memvault captures: /app/memvault/samples/*.mem
memvault cards: /app/memvault/cards/*.ref
running release file: /app/livekern/running.release
=== route map ===
lagpipe synctab wiring notes (internal)

Modules linked by `make -C /app/lagpipe bind` participate in synctab:
  layout pick — chooses sched_entity table input for synctab
  types writer — materializes synctab_out/layout.tbl from the picked table
  tag policy gate — decides whether procance lines are acceptable on this image
  probe emitter — decodes memvault captures through layout.tbl offsets

Field layout rules and CLI contract: /app/lagpipe/fieldnotes/FIELD_RULES.txt
